* TOOL_MASTERS
* The master files on one screen: whether they are set up, what the journal holds, every account against its master copy, and SYNC.MASTERS behind two keys (S.75, plan .claude/plan-fullscreen-toolkit.md
* section 5, A7; S.67 is the master files themselves).
